      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Vidalia once hosted the Vidalia Indians, a Class D minor league baseball team that won the 1953 Georgia State League championship.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
